1
00:00:00,828 --> 00:00:02,258
(Penny:)who should not be
eating cheesecake,

2
00:00:02,263 --> 00:00:04,233
(Penny:)to have more cheesecake.

3
00:00:04,232 --> 00:00:05,602
(Howard:)I mean,

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,600
(Penny:)one of those chubsters
even had an insulin pump!

5
00:00:07,602 --> 00:00:10,202
Uh-huh!

6
00:00:11,406 --> 00:00:14,336
(Dan:)I have an insulin pump.

7
00:00:16,678 --> 00:00:18,748
(Penny:)People.
(quiet laugh)

8
00:00:21,516 --> 00:00:23,046
(Howard:)It's weird, right?

9
00:00:23,051 --> 00:00:26,421
A grown man in his 30s
living with my mother.

10
00:00:26,421 --> 00:00:27,751
(Raj:)That is weird.

11
00:00:27,755 --> 00:00:30,925
(Raj:)I thought he was, like, 45.

12
00:00:30,925 --> 00:00:32,925
(Howard:)Come on, you don't think
it's a little odd?

13
00:00:32,927 --> 00:00:35,027
I don't know!
I mean, she's lonely.

14
00:00:35,029 --> 00:00:36,459
(Raj:)He needs a place to stay.

15
00:00:36,464 --> 00:00:38,364
(Raj:)I doubt there's
any funny business going on.

16
00:00:38,366 --> 00:00:39,666
(Raj:)And even if there was,

17
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:41,167
(Raj:)who cares?
They're both adults.

18
00:00:41,169 --> 00:00:42,599
"Who cares"?!
You wouldn't care

19
00:00:42,604 --> 00:00:44,574
(Howard:)if I slept with your mom?

20
00:00:44,572 --> 00:00:46,272
(Raj:)You know what?
You're my best friend,

21
00:00:46,274 --> 00:00:47,574
(Raj:)and she's in a bad marriage.

22
00:00:47,575 --> 00:00:49,675
(Raj:)I give you my blessing.

23
00:00:49,677 --> 00:00:52,047
(Howard:)This is stupid.

24
00:00:52,046 --> 00:00:55,346
(Howard:)I'm just gonna call my mother
and be honest with her.

25
00:00:55,350 --> 00:01:00,020
'Cause that's
what little matzo balls do.

